"""
Score farms (first 10 European farms) using:
1) OLD SCORE AS WEIGHT → BEST1 / B3ST2 / BEST3
2) NEW SCORE AS WEIGHT → NEW-BEST / NEW_BES2 / NEW_BEST3

Output workbook (mi_archivo_final.xlsx):
- Sheet "Farms_EU":
    farms + OLD scores + NEW scores + subcategory sums
- Sheet "Scores_NEW":
    only NEW scores (ScoreNEW__*) + Total_Score_NEW
- Sheet "Scores_OLD":
    only OLD scores (ScoreOLD__*) + Total_Score_OLD
- Sheet "Scores_Vertical":
    one row per Question with columns:
      ID, Question,
      Farm1_old, Farm1_new, ..., FarmN_old, FarmN_new,
      Average_OLD, SD_OLD_±,
      Average_NEW, SD_NEW_±
- Sheet "Subcategories":
    subcategory sums per farm:
      FarmID, Country (if available),
      <Code>_<Label>_OLD, <Code>_<Label>_NEW for A..K
- Sheet "Subcategories_Stats":
    one row per subcategory (A..K) with:
      Code, Subcategory,
      Average_OLD, SD_OLD_±,
      Average_NEW, SD_NEW_±

Author: you
"""

